Conjures [2, 2, 2, 2, 3 (TL1-5)] missile-shaped rocks that you target individually at any target or targets in range.  Each missile deals [60, 81, 98, 111, 124 (TL1-5; SP 100)] physical damage, and an additional [10, 14, 16, 19, 21 (TL1-5; SP 100)] bleeding damage every turn for 5 turns.

At talent level 5, you can conjure one additional missile.

The damage will increase with your Spellpower.
